            "rubricHtml": "<p>Questions 11–16</p>",
            "selectCount": 1,
            "bodyHtml": "<p>Complete the table below. Write <strong>NO MORE THAN THREE WORDS AND/OR A NUMBER</strong> for each answer.</p><div><table class=\"q-table\"><tbody><tr><th>Vacation job</th><th>Main advantage</th><th>Main disadvantage</th><th>Recommendation</th></tr><tr><td>Stocktaking</td><td>{{11}}</td><td>Tiring</td><td>{{12}}</td></tr><tr><td>Office work</td><td>Air-conditioning</td><td>{{13}}</td><td>Choose a {{14}}</td></tr><tr><td>Theme park attendant</td><td>{{15}}</td><td>Rude customers</td><td>{{16}}</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
            "maxWords": 3
          },
          {
            "id": "part-2-group-2",
            "type": "mcq",
            "rubricHtml": "<p>Questions 17–20</p>",
            "selectCount": 1,
            "questions": [
              {
                "number": 17,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;Peter learned about the job",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "from a college friend."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "on the computer."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "from a student job centre."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 18,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;Peter mainly enjoyed the job because it was",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "easy."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "challenging."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "unusual."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 19,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;The job's most interesting aspect was",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "learning about the environment."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "working with children."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "caring for the animals."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 20,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;Peter has decided that next vacation he",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "won't take a job."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "will work at the zoo."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "will work elsewhere."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
